WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:07.050
I wonder what it will be?  
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.950
It's the legendary Tuner Majestic Dragon!

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:13.370
What will it Synchro Summon?

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:15.010
Stay tuned to find out!

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.430
Stop being sneaky!

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:23.000
Due to Hundred-Eyes Dragon's effect, it gains 
the effect of Infernity Dwarf in my graveyard!

00:00:23.970 --> 00:00:28.950
When I have no cards in my hand and 
your monster is in defense position...

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:31.770
...if my attacking monster's 
attack points are greater than

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:34.770
your monster's defense points, you 
take the difference as damage!

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:48.430
What's wrong, Yusei?  I'm 
going to keep attacking!

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.740
Infernity Archfiend will attack Max Warrior-

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:55.420
What?  It has less attack 
points than Max Warrior?

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:59.170
When Ghost Gardna is destroyed 
and sent to the graveyard...

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:03.290
...one of your monsters loses 1000 
attack points until the End Phase!

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:05.740
I end my turn.

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:06.970
My turn!

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:11.520
I summon the Tuner Monster Junk Synchron!

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.590
Level 3 Junk Synchron tunes 
Level 2 Speed Warrior!

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:27.030
The stars come together 
to call forth a new power!

00:01:27.030 --> 00:01:28.500
Become the path that lights the way!

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.070
Synchro Summon!

00:01:30.070 --> 00:01:32.000
Come forth, Junk Warrior!

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:42.350
I flip over my trap card 
Synchro Striker Unit.

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:48.450
This card becomes an Equip Card, and the 
equipped monster gains 1000 attack points!

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:58.060
Battle!  Max Warrior attacks 
Infernity Archfiend!

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:02.400
And it has an effect!

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:06.840
That's right.  While it's attacking, 
it gains 400 attack points!

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:09.010
Destroy it!  Swift Rush!

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:14.550
Don't underestimate my handless 
combo!  I flip over my trap card!

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:16.560
Infernity Force!

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:20.430
If you attack my Infernity monster 
when I have no cards in my hand...

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:22.790
...your attacking monster is destroyed!

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:33.430
Then I can Special Summon one Level 
4-or-below Infernity monster from my graveyard.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.800
I Special Summon Infernity Necromancer!

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:43.380
Junk Warrior attacks Hundred-Eyes Dragon!

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:02.490
Awesome!  He finally defeated 
Hundred-Eyes Dragon!

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:03.960
Wait, that's what he wanted.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:08.370
Due to Hundred-Eyes Dragon's effect...

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:13.720
...when it's destroyed, I can select one 
card in my deck and add it to my hand.

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:20.260
He used Hundred-Eyes Dragon 
in order to get that card.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:26.150
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:03:26.150 --> 00:03:31.250
Due to Synchro Striker 
Unit's effect, Junk Warrior

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:36.250
loses 800 attack points during 
each of my End Phases.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:41.570
It's an Earthbound Immortal.

00:03:41.570 --> 00:03:44.620
But I must find a way to rescue Kiryu.

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:02.670
Looking over a vast distance

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:07.770
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:12.680
Even if it's easier to throw myself away

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:17.450
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:04:19.310 --> 00:04:22.810
No matter how bad today is

00:04:24.390 --> 00:04:27.790
There's still the faintest light

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:33.200
All I have to do tomorrow

00:04:33.490 --> 00:04:37.260
Is light it myself

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:42.270
I test myself so I won't stop or vanish

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:47.240
Even if I get countless scars

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:53.540
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:57.520
Today will never exist again

00:04:57.850 --> 00:05:03.420
So I won't stop or vanish

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:32.960
Caring for Friends
Majestic Dragon

00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:44.590
Yusei, it's the same as before.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.870
You're trying to rescue Kiryu.

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:52.060
That's right.  Kiryu, I'll 
save you from destruction!

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:11.520
Hey!

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:16.640
What's going on?  Aren't you 
going to battle alongside me?

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.500
This is our last duel!

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.040
Wake up, Kiryu!

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:23.320
There's no way we can defeat Security!

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:25.020
You guys…

00:06:25.380 --> 00:06:28.200
Kiryu, we have to escape.

00:06:29.930 --> 00:06:32.600
I know you're not satisfied yet.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:36.000
By defeating Security, we'll 
truly conquer Satellite.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.800
Let's do it!  Let's do our duel!

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:43.460
We don't see eye-to-eye anymore.

00:06:43.460 --> 00:06:44.430
What?

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:47.420
But we're still friends.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.690
We want to rescue you from Security.

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:51.660
Kiryu!

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:54.980
Why is this happening?

00:06:55.360 --> 00:07:00.680
Me and you are…

00:07:01.750 --> 00:07:03.890
Security has started their attack!

00:07:05.640 --> 00:07:07.840
Duel and capture them!

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:16.510
Against Security's overwhelming power, 
the only thing we could do was flee.

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:20.000
But Kiryu…

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:25.410
Even if we escape from Satellite, 
there's nowhere to go.

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.930
So I'll keep fighting, even if I'm all alone!

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:36.970
Duel!

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:39.940
I draw!  I summon Vorse Raider!

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:46.680
You piece of Satellite 
garbage, I'll squash you!

00:07:46.680 --> 00:07:48.890
I summon Montage Dragon!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.920
Take this!

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:00.480
What?

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.560
Kiryu, stop!

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:10.300
Kiryu!

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:29.460
We'll crush you.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:34.760
We'll crush Security and conquer Satellite!

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:36.100
Stop it!

00:08:40.230 --> 00:08:42.120
Let go of me, Yusei!

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:45.300
We have to crush Satellite, Yusei!

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.360
It's only a matter of 
time before they find us.

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:03.140
Take care of Kiryu for me.

00:09:10.760 --> 00:09:13.400
I'm the leader of Team Satisfaction!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:17.870
I'm the one who attacked Security 
headquarters!  The other three had nothing to do with it!

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:19.640
Arrest me!

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:20.990
Yusei…

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:28.070
We only want the leader.  The 
other three are free to go.

00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:29.960
But we have to confirm who's the leader!

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:30.450
What?

00:09:33.180 --> 00:09:34.240
Kiryu!

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.620
Kiryu!

00:09:36.060 --> 00:09:37.860
Wait, you're making a mistake!

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:39.090
Look.

00:09:39.090 --> 00:09:42.550
Treason against Security is 
a crime in the first degree.

00:09:42.550 --> 00:09:45.380
You will never meet him again.

00:09:56.770 --> 00:09:58.880
Yusei!

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:03.080
You betrayed me!  You sold me out!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:04.830
You're wrong, Kiryu!

00:10:07.850 --> 00:10:09.890
Yusei!

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:12.860
Yusei!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:15.440
Kiryu!

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:18.960
Kiryu!

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:29.100
Jack, Crow and I really wanted 
to save you back then!

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:31.460
You betrayed me!

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:32.510
You sold me out!

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:37.150
You're wrong!  Yusei tried to 
surrender to Security in your place!

00:10:37.150 --> 00:10:40.390
Why didn't you battle alongside 
me until the very end?

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:42.500
You surrendered to Security!

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:49.840
That means you sold out Team Satisfaction!

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:50.930
Kiryu…

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:59.370
Do you know what happens to 
people who attack Security?

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:09.450
At the prison, the guards targeted me.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:11.450
They were violent.

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:15.080
We visited many times.

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:17.570
But we weren't allowed to see you.

00:11:17.570 --> 00:11:20.420
Eventually, they told us that you died.

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:23.360
It's not that simple!

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:27.010
I could've withstood their abuse forever.

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:31.980
But they took away my deck, 
which I value more than my life!

00:11:34.530 --> 00:11:37.610
I'm a messenger from the afterlife.

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:41.710
You must decide whether to end your own life.

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:46.720
What regrets will you leave 
behind in this world?

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:53.670
If you become a Dark Signer, I 
will make your dreams come true.

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:59.550
I want to get revenge on someone.  And...

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:07.940
By becoming a Dark Signer, I 
vowed to get revenge on you!

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:13.940
With my Earthbound Immortal, I'll make 
you face the same fear that I faced!

00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:15.700
My turn!

00:12:16.930 --> 00:12:21.840
I release Infernity Archfiend 
and Infernity Necromancer!

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:31.900
Descend, Earthbound Immortal Ccapac Apu!

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:02.410
It's here.

00:13:02.410 --> 00:13:03.380
Yusei…

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:05.530
Earthbound Immortal…

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:08.770
You're facing Earthbound 
Immortal's terror once again!

00:13:08.770 --> 00:13:12.040
Ccapac Apu attacks you directly!

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:44.400
Kiryu, if the fear I'm facing now is the 
same fear that you felt, then I won't run away!

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:48.410
I will face your fear by 
defeating Earthbound Immortal!

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:52.510
I flip over my trap card Baton of the Hero!

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:56.380
I get to decide your monster's 
attack target this turn!

00:13:56.570 --> 00:13:57.610
What?

00:13:57.610 --> 00:14:00.600
Earthbound Immortal's target is Junk Warrior!

00:14:05.670 --> 00:14:08.410
You used your monster as a 
shield to dodge the attack!

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:11.160
But Ccapac Apu's effect activates!

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:16.490
When it destroys your monster, you take 
damage equal to that monster's attack points!

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:21.250
This is bad!  Junk Warrior 
has 2500 attack points.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.140
That's more than Yusei's life points!

00:14:23.140 --> 00:14:24.010
Yusei!

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:27.570
I flip over my trap card 
BURST SYNCHRO SUMMON!

00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:30.560
Once this turn, damage from 
an effect becomes zero!

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:38.660
Next, I ignore the summoning conditions 
and Special Summon a Synchro

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:43.660
Monster whose attack points are equal 
to the effect damage I negated!

00:14:43.660 --> 00:14:47.120
Which Synchro Monster has 2500 attack points?

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:48.330
Stardust Dragon!

00:14:48.630 --> 00:14:50.330
Well done, Yusei!

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.770
So that's why you destroyed Junk Warrior!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.740
Soar, Stardust Dragon!

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:05.410
Yusei's ace monster has arrived!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:08.390
I set one card and end my turn!

00:15:08.390 --> 00:15:09.810
My turn!

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:14.600
I flip over my trap card 
Brilliant Shrine Art!

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:19.380
When your monster attacks, Earthbound 
Immortal can take that attack instead!

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:24.070
That means Stardust Dragon's attack 
will aim towards Earthbound Immortal.

00:15:24.760 --> 00:15:27.840
I activate Speed Spell - Angel Baton!

00:15:27.840 --> 00:15:31.310
I draw two cards, and then I send one 
card in my hand to the graveyard.

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:35.430
The card I sent to the graveyard 
was Stardust Xiaolong!

00:15:35.430 --> 00:15:40.440
When Stardust Dragon is on the field, this 
monster resurrects from the graveyard!

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:46.720
I set one card and end my turn.

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:48.210
My turn!

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:52.680
I flip over my trap card Superior Protector!

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:55.700
I equip this card on Stardust Dragon!

00:15:56.580 --> 00:16:02.140
Now I only take battle damage 
when Stardust Dragon battles!

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:04.730
You stopped me from attacking you directly?

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:07.380
I'll crush that piece of celestial garbage!

00:16:07.380 --> 00:16:11.380
Earthbound Immortal Ccapac 
Apu attacks Stardust Dragon!

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:16.790
Superior Protector's effect activates!

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:20.750
By sending this card to the graveyard, 
it can't be destroyed in battle!

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:23.560
But you still take battle damage.

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:26.320
I flip over my trap card Wicked Trample!

00:16:26.320 --> 00:16:30.630
When you take battle damage from a 
non-direct attack, the damage is doubled!

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:31.600
What?

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:33.070
Go!

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:35.550
Earthbound Immortal Ccapac Apu!

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:48.610
Kiryu!

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:50.350
Kiryu!

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:52.290
No way!

00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.010
Kiryu!

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:01.830
Yusei…

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:04.330
I was wrong.

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:09.600
Back then, I thought I could 
save you by sacrificing myself.

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.310
But I was wrong!

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:15.650
I can save a friend by believing in our bond!

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:17.380
Yusei…

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:18.790
Yusei...

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:26.560
Yusei!  Kiryu!

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:31.530
I can sense Yusei's feelings.

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:36.640
Jack and Crow feel the same way as me.

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:40.730
And our new friends also support us.

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:44.010
This battle isn't to defeat you.

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:48.010
It's to save you, our friend, 
from the Dark Signers!

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:50.190
Yusei…

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:54.480
It's too late!

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:58.020
Kiryu!

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:03.430
The mark!

00:18:03.640 --> 00:18:04.390
It vanished?

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:12.230
What's that?

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:14.720
Our marks have gathered on Yusei.

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:18.340
Our feelings unite and become one.

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:20.950
What's this?

00:18:24.130 --> 00:18:25.360
My turn!

00:18:26.930 --> 00:18:28.350
I see!

00:18:28.820 --> 00:18:32.860
This card holds our feelings so 
that we can create a miracle!

00:18:33.540 --> 00:18:35.590
I'll save Kiryu with this card!

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:39.590
I summon the Tuner Monster Majestic Dragon!

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:49.030
Majestic Dragon tunes Stardust 
Dragon and Stardust Xiaolong!

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:58.750
The shining stars come together 
to illuminate a new miracle!

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:01.330
Become the path that lights the way!

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:04.670
Synchro Summon!

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:07.860
Arrive, Majestic Star Dragon!

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:18.050
Majestic Star Dragon negates one of your 
monsters' effects and gains them until the End Phase!

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:22.270
I gain Earthbound Immortal's 
effects!  Sublimation Drain!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:34.450
Majestic Star Dragon attacks 
Earthbound Immortal Ccapac Apu!

00:19:39.830 --> 00:19:41.890
Shooting Blaster Sonic!

00:19:55.570 --> 00:19:56.920
Kiryu!

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:04.750
Pull yourself together, Kiryu!

00:20:04.940 --> 00:20:06.770
I won't forsake my friend!

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:08.720
I'll save you this time!

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:14.010
Yusei, Earthbound Immortal 
Ccapac Apu's effect deals

00:20:14.010 --> 00:20:19.010
damage equal to the destroyed 
monster's attack points.

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:24.930
In other words, I take a total 
of 3800 points in damage.

00:20:27.730 --> 00:20:33.240
When I became a Dark Signer, 
I made one more wish.

00:20:34.190 --> 00:20:41.260
I wanted Team Satisfaction to have one 
last duel that we couldn't have back then.

00:20:44.320 --> 00:20:45.360
Kiryu…

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:55.870
I couldn't hate you enough.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.770
How embarrassing.

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:04.940
I don't feel satisfied.

00:21:09.150 --> 00:21:10.250
Kiryu...

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:27.750
Kiryu, you're my friend.

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:36.120
For you and the rest of my friends, 
I promise to defeat the Dark Signers!

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:41.000
Kiryu!

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:02.580
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:07.650
We will build our own future

00:22:08.120 --> 00:22:13.090
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:13.550 --> 00:22:18.260
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:33.400
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:38.970
This world can't be solved using algorithms

00:22:39.040 --> 00:22:43.680
Even if it loses its light

00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:48.950
The hourglass behind the 
heart can't be turned

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:53.420
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:22:53.620 --> 00:22:59.000
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:22:59.130 --> 00:23:03.880
This journey has no end

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:09.340
There's no meaning because there are no tears

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:14.580
Hear my voice
